The sideways reach of a keyframe's handle is called influence: it sets how long the ease lasts. Easy Ease gives every key the same reach, so every move feels the same. Make each move start quickly and land softly: at the landing key, drag the handle sideways along the bottom to make the ease longer, and at the start key, shorten it.

